<title>USA: American Home Alliance sets stock split.</title>
<headline>American Home Alliance sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BAKERSFIELD, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Home Alliance Industries Ltd said Friday its board has approved a two-for-one stock split for shareholders of record on Sept 18.</p>
<p>The company also said it has changed its name to Alliance Industries.</p>
</text>
